# Woow H618 reference machine — grant the pi user sudo without a password.
#
# Rationale:
#   - Matches the Armbian factory default UX ("no password prompt on sudo").
#   - This machine is behind LAN + tailnet + CF Access; a password prompt on
#     sudo does not defend against any threat that the earlier layers do not
#     already stop.
#   - The pi user runs rootless podman; sudo is only used for maintenance,
#     not for day-to-day service operation. Prompting on every apt/systemctl
#     during troubleshooting is friction without value.
#
# If you disagree with this trade-off, remove this file and run:
#   sudo passwd pi
# ...then interactive sudo will work with the password.
pi ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:ALL
